// > by name length: Cy Di Ed Ann Bob
// > city, then age: Bern:Ed Bern:Cy Oslo:Di Oslo:Ann Rome:Bob
// > oldest first:   Ann Cy Bob Ed Di
// > descending:     98 92 81 76 70 ...
